{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"The visibility flag is now persisted independently and returned by both product read paths; shopper detail/list queries enforce `visible=true`, while the new `/api/v1/private/products` route uses the admin-origin query. I also added the checkout guard before order creation and mapped hidden-cart checkout failures to 409. I’m compiling now to catch cross-module API mismatches."}}
